00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.020
So the Avalon Solutions chatbot
has AutoML entity extraction--

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:04.520
sorry--

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:06.890
AutoML Sentiment
Analysis built-in

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:09.320
